{"id":"388404d10410a0261b45613aadc7a683599e533f","url":"https://www.businessinsider.com/white-house-ai-si-era-new-website-domain-url-2026-10","title":"The White House is in its Trump-fueled SI era","site_name":"TechURLs","source":"Business Insider","byline":"Brent D. Griffiths","excerpt":"The White House changed the URL of AI.gov to SI.gov.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n    \n      \n    \n      <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n    \n          \n          \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                        <p><span>By</span>\n                                \n                                \n                                \n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"Brent D. Griffiths\">\n                                \n                                    <span>\n                                      <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-name\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/brent-d-griffiths\">Brent D. Griffiths</a>        \n                                  <span data-disable-for-sooth-user=\"\" data-component-type=\"follow-button\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" role=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip-position=\"middle\" data-tooltip-active=\"false\" data-state=\"\" data-topic-type=\"author\" data-topic-slug=\"brent-d-griffiths\" data-topic-link=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/brent-d-griffiths\" data-topic-label=\"Brent D. Griffiths\" data-topic-location=\"byline\" data-topic-shortened-label=\"Brent D. Griffiths\">\n                                    \n                                  \n                                    <div>\n                                      <p>\n                                          You're currently following this author!\n                                   Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n                                      </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    \n                                  </span>\n                                    </span>\n                                  </span>  </p>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6ace6c1dadb77227909a4dfa?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"Donald Trump points during a rally\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <span>\n                              <span>\n                                \n                                <label for=\"caption-drawer-btn\">\n                                          </label>\n                        \n                            <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">\n                              <span>President Donald Trump has said that those who continue to use the term artificial intelligence will be considered an \"enemy\" of his White House.</span>\n                              <span>\n                                <span data-e2e-name=\"image-source\" itemprop=\"creditText\">Roberto Schmidt/Getty Images</span>      </span>\n                            </figcaption>\n                          </span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n            \n      \n              \n      \n      \n            \n      \n              \n              \n              \n              \n      \n            \n      \n        <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                  \n                      <p>The White House has finally addressed a remnant of the AI era.</p><p>On Tuesday, the Trump administration rolled out si.gov, giving a new URL to the site that was first launched during the Biden administration. The new site describes <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/donald-trump\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;outbound_click&quot;}\" rel=\" nofollow\">President Donald Trump</a>'s artificial intelligence policies, though much of the text itself was changed before Tuesday.</p><p>\"The Super Intelligence era is here. 🇺🇸,\" Michael Kratsios, the director of the White House Office of Science and Technology Policy, wrote on X.</p><p>The new address falls in line with Trump's wishes that artificial intelligence, or AI, now be called super intelligence, or SI. The president formalized his preference <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/trump-rebrands-ai-to-super-intelligence-in-new-executive-order-2026-9\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">in a September 29 executive order.</a></p><p>Last week, Trump declared that if others did not go along with his rebrand, they would be considered an <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/trump-super-intelligence-rebrand-enemy-white-house-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">\"enemy\" of his White House. </a>The president has said that using the term \"artificial intelligence\" makes the technology sound fake.</p><p>AI and tech leaders have split over how to handle Trump's request.</p><p>Over the weekend, SpaceXAI followed through on SpaceX CEO <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/tesla-ceo-elon-musk\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">Elon Musk</a>'s promise to rebrand the company's AI division as SpaceXSI.</p><p>On Saturday, days after Trump bestowed an honor on him, Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/microsoft-ceo-satya-nadella-ai-threat-blog-enterprise-companies-corporations-2026-10\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;index&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" rel=\"\">published</a> a lengthy statement titled: \"Models as Insider Risks in the Super Intelligence Era.\" AI and artificial intelligence were not among the 805 words Nadella wrote.</p><p>As for OpenAI, whose name contains the very abbreviation Trump wants gone, its CEO, Sam Altman, previously ruled out a rebrand.</p>\n                    \n                  \n                    \n                  <p>\"No plans to do that,\" Altman <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\" nofollow\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2OOHnaGTQFg\" data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_type&quot;:&quot;other&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;body_link&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;outbound_click&quot;}\"><u>told</u></a> the Politico Decoded podcast. \"But we have been talking about super intelligence a lot, and we will continue to talk about it.\"</p>\n                  \n                  \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6ace68af9273929ed75e5217\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>Read next</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;Read next&quot;}\" data-recommendations-content=\"\"