I division as SpaceXSI.On Saturday, days after Trump bestowed an honor on him, Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella published a lengthy statement titled: \"Models as Insider Risks in the Super Intelligence Era.\" AI and artificial intelligence were not among the 805 words Nadella wrote.As for OpenAI, whose name contains the very abbreviation Trump wants gone, its CEO, Sam Altman, previously ruled out a rebrand. \"No plans to do that,\" Altman told the Politico Decoded podcast. \"But we have been talking about super intelligence a lot, and we will continue to talk about it.\" Read next Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know Business Insider tells the innovative stories you want to know Brent D. Griffiths You're currently following this author! Click to unsubscribe from email alerts. Brent Griffiths is a senior reporter at Business Insider who covers AI and tech. Previously, he worked at the Washington Post. He started his career at Politico. White House Donald Trump","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T15:35:13.760Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p><span>By</span>\n                                \n                                \n                                \n                                  <span data-e2e-name=\"Brent D. Griffiths\">\n                                \n                                    <span>\n                                      <a data-e2e-name=\"byline-author-name\" href=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/author/brent-d-griffiths\">Brent D. Griffiths</a>        \n                                  <span data-disable-for-sooth-user=\"\" data-component-type=\"follow-button\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" role=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip-position=\"middle\" data-tooltip-active=\"false\" data-state=\"\" data-topic-type=\"author\" data-topic-slug=\"brent-d-griffiths\" data-topic-link=\"https://www.businessinsider.com/a